    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Synopsis the Finally, Our Love Is Eternal.</h2>Let's start with the hero, named Jonathan, meets Dorathy at the beach. From that day, the two fell in love and lived happily ever after. until one day There was a change in the lord in which the two people lived. which this lord has greed wanting other people's things to be theirs until that governor met Dorathy and a desire for Dorathy became his own therefore devised a scheme to steal Dorathy from the Jonathan And that's the beginning of the separation.<br>When Jonathan was devised by the governor By separating the two lovers, the governor sent Jonathan to a distant place. Jonathan must try to travel back to his beloved wife Dorathy. So the story of Jonathan's journey begins.<br><br>in-game content<br>1. You will find an adventurous journey. Go with a companion who has friendship, love and sacrifice.<br>2. There are puzzles to solve during the journey. Get information from the villagers to translate the clues into the door password numbers. to pass the checkpoint<br>3. Fight enemies using commands. When you win, you will gain experience to level up your character. And earn money to buy things in the game shop<br>4. You will find more than 1 ending by your own judgment. Deciding on an option will lead to a different ending.<br>5. There is a gacha to find legendary weapons<br>6. Find materials to make powerful weapons.",
